//    No  -> Use a regular enum.
//    Yes -> Q: Java 17+ available?
//            Yes -> Use sealed interface + records.
//            No  -> Q: Need enum features (EnumSet, switch)?
//                    Yes -> Enum + Class token.
//                    No  -> Static final instances.
